@api = http://localhost:4000/api/v1

### Liveness (public)
GET {{api}}/health

### Sign in as the demo customer
# @name login
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "priya@example.com", "password": "Demo@1234" }

###
@token = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Who am I
GET {{api}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Accounts with balances
# @name accounts
GET {{api}}/accounts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
@accountId = {{accounts.response.body.data[0].id}}

### Dashboard overview (balances, cash flow, spending)
GET {{api}}/accounts/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statement (JSON, paginated and filterable)
GET {{api}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/statement?page=1&limit=10&direction=DEBIT
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statement as XML
GET {{api}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/statement.xml
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Statement rendered from the XML by XSLT (HTML)
GET {{api}}/accounts/{{accountId}}/statement.html
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Payees
GET {{api}}/beneficiaries
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### IFSC lookup (live directory with offline fallback)
GET {{api}}/ifsc/HDFC0000240
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Transfer step 1: quote (fee, rail, risk score and OTP challenge)
POST {{api}}/transfers/quote
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "fromAccountId": "{{accountId}}", "mode": "OWN", "toAccountId": "{{accounts.response.body.data[1].id}}", "amount": 50000, "purpose": "TRANSFER" }

### Transactions with filters
GET {{api}}/transactions?status=COMPLETED&limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Debit cards
GET {{api}}/cards
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Exchange rates (ECB data via Frankfurter, cached)
GET {{api}}/forex/rates
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Malformed JSON: uniform error envelope with a request ID
POST {{api}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "priya@example.com", "password":
